<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"64"><strong>Timeout Config</=
strong><span>&nbsp;</span>(from<span>&nbsp;</span><code>IDGraphAzureAppConf=
ig</code>):</p>
<ul class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"65">
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"65">Cascade:<span>&nbsp;</span><code>a=
ppconfig.apiclient.rest.{Operation}.{timeout}</code><span>&nbsp;</span>=E2=
=86=92<span>&nbsp;</span><code>apiclient.rest.{Operation}.{timeout}</code><=
span>&nbsp;</span>=E2=86=92<span>&nbsp;</span><code>apiclient.rest.default.=
{timeout}</code><span>&nbsp;</span>=E2=86=92 hardcoded default (10000/15000=
/200)</li>
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"66">All 21 APIs have independent<span>=
&nbsp;</span><code>connectTimeout</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>readTimeo=
ut</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>maxConnectionsTotal</code></li>
</ul>
