</div>
<h3 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"240" id=3D"IDGraphRESTOutbo=
undClientAnalysis-SDKDefaultTimeoutOnly(NeedsImprovement=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F)=
">SDK Default Timeout Only (Needs Improvement =E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F)</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table style=3D"" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<thead class=3D"">
<tr class=3D"">
<th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">MS</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Clients</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Timeout Source</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Gap</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody class=3D"">
<tr class=3D"">
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong>UserAssociationMs</strong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">4 clients</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>apiclient.rest.default.*</code></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">All share one timeout; no per-client tuning</td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"">
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong>UserManagementMs</strong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">2 clients</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>apiclient.rest.default.*</code></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Same</td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"">
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong>CustomerHubMs</strong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">3 clients</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>apiclient.rest.default.*</code></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Same</td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"">
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong>UserRegistrationMs</strong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">2 clients</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>apiclient.rest.default.*</code></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Same</td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"">
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong>UserEventsMs</strong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">1 client (12 APIs)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>apiclient.rest.default.*</code></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">12 APIs sharing one RestTemplate/timeout</td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"">
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong>ConsumerMs</strong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">3 clients</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>apiclient.rest.default.*</code></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Direct RestTemplate, no factory benefits</td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"">
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong>BatchMs</strong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">1 client</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>apiclient.rest.default.*</code></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Direct RestTemplate, no factory benefits</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"252">
<h2 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"254" id=3D"IDGraphRESTOutbo=
undClientAnalysis-Recommendations">Recommendations</h2>
<h3 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"256" id=3D"IDGraphRESTOutbo=
undClientAnalysis-R1.MigrateDirectRestTemplateClientstoRestTemplateBeanFact=
ory">R1. Migrate Direct<span>&nbsp;</span><code>RestTemplate</code><span>&n=
bsp;</span>Clients to<span>&nbsp;</span><code>RestTemplateBeanFactory</code=
></h3>
<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"258"><strong>Priority</stron=
g>: HIGH<br><strong>Affected</strong>:<span>&nbsp;</span><code>idgraphusere=
ventsms</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>idgraphconsumerms</code>,<span>&nbs=
p;</span><code>idgraphbatchms</code><span>&nbsp;</span>(5 clients total)</p=
>
<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"261"><strong>Problem</strong=
>: Direct<span>&nbsp;</span><code>RestTemplate</code><span>&nbsp;</span>inj=
ection bypasses IDP SDK's TLS configuration, connection pool management, lo=
gging interceptors, and timeout management provided by<span>&nbsp;</span><c=
ode>RestTemplateBeanFactory</code>.</p>
<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"263"><strong>Action</strong>=
:</p>
<ol class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"264">
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"264">Register each client with a named=
 factory key in<span>&nbsp;</span><code>application.properties</code><span>=
&nbsp;</span>(e.g.,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>apiclient.rest.identitygraphcli=
ent.*</code>)</li>
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"265">Change constructor to accept<span=
>&nbsp;</span><code>RestTemplateBeanFactory</code><span>&nbsp;</span>and ca=
ll<span>&nbsp;</span><code>.getObject(clientName)</code></li>
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"266">Add per-client<span>&nbsp;</span>=
<code>connectTimeout</code><span>&nbsp;</span>and<span>&nbsp;</span><code>r=
eadTimeout</code><span>&nbsp;</span>properties</li>
</ol>
<hr class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"268">
<h3 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"270" id=3D"IDGraphRESTOutbo=
undClientAnalysis-R2.AddPer-ClientTimeoutConfiguration">R2. Add Per-Client =
Timeout Configuration</h3>
<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"272"><strong>Priority</stron=
g>: HIGH<br><strong>Affected</strong>: All MSes currently using only<span>&=
nbsp;</span><code>apiclient.rest.default.*</code></p>
<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"275"><strong>Problem</strong=
>: A slow downstream service (e.g., OrderGraph) blocks threads with the glo=
bal timeout, starving faster APIs.</p>
<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"277"><strong>Action</strong>=
:</p>
<ol class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"278">
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"278">Define<span>&nbsp;</span><code>ap=
iclient.rest.&lt;clientKey&gt;.connectTimeout</code><span>&nbsp;</span>and<=
span>&nbsp;</span><code>apiclient.rest.&lt;clientKey&gt;.readTimeout</code>=
<span>&nbsp;</span>in Helm configs</li>
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"279">Follow the naming pattern:<span>&=
nbsp;</span><code>apiclient.rest.{factoryKey}.connectTimeout/readTimeout</c=
ode></li>
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"280">For MSes with Azure App Config, a=
dd<span>&nbsp;</span><code>appconfig.apiclient.rest.{factoryKey}.*</code><s=
pan>&nbsp;</span>overrides</li>
</ol>
<hr class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"282">
<h3 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"284" id=3D"IDGraphRESTOutbo=
undClientAnalysis-R3.AdoptCentralizedRestTemplateConfigPattern">R3. Adopt C=
entralized<span>&nbsp;</span><code>RestTemplateConfig</code><span>&nbsp;</s=
pan>Pattern</h3>
<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"286"><strong>Priority</stron=
g>: MEDIUM<br><strong>Model</strong>:<span>&nbsp;</span><code>idgraphmpsada=
pterms</code><span>&nbsp;</span><code>RestTemplateConfig</code></p>
<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"289"><strong>Problem</strong=
>: Most MSes create<span>&nbsp;</span><code>RestTemplate</code><span>&nbsp;=
</span>inline in each client constructor, making timeout refresh require in=
dividual<span>&nbsp;</span><code>@EventListener</code><span>&nbsp;</span>in=
 every client.</p>
<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"291"><strong>Action</strong>=
: Create one<span>&nbsp;</span><code>RestTemplateConfig</code><span>&nbsp;<=
/span>per MS that:</p>
<ol class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"292">
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"292">Creates all named<span>&nbsp;</sp=
an><code>@Bean</code><span>&nbsp;</span>RestTemplate instances centrally</l=
i>
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"293">Handles<span>&nbsp;</span><code>R=
efreshScopeRefreshedEvent</code><span>&nbsp;</span>to refresh all timeouts =
in one place</li>
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"294">Exposes beans via<span>&nbsp;</sp=
an><code>@Qualifier</code><span>&nbsp;</span>for each client</li>
</ol>
<hr class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"296">
<h3 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"298" id=3D"IDGraphRESTOutbo=
undClientAnalysis-R4.StandardizeErrorHandling">R4. Standardize Error Handli=
ng</h3>
<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"300"><strong>Priority</stron=
g>: MEDIUM</p>
<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"302"><strong>Problem</strong=
>: Error handling varies widely:</p>
<ul class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"303">
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"303">Some use<span>&nbsp;</span><code>=
CommonErrorMap.makeCategoryMap()</code><span>&nbsp;</span>(CGRestClient, MP=
SYSInternalRestClient)</li>
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"304">Some throw<span>&nbsp;</span><cod=
e>ServiceException</code><span>&nbsp;</span>(CGAssociatedUserClient)</li>
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"305">Some save to Cosmos (ApiRestClien=
t, GenericApiRestClient)</li>
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"306">Some just rethrow (McafeeClientHe=
lper)</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"308"><strong>Action</strong>=
: Create a shared<span>&nbsp;</span><code>RestClientErrorHandler</code><spa=
n>&nbsp;</span>in<span>&nbsp;</span><code>idgraphcommonhelper</code><span>&=
nbsp;</span>that:</p>
<ol class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"309">
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"309">Classifies exceptions as retryabl=
e vs non-retryable</li>
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"310">Returns a standard<span>&nbsp;</s=
pan><code>RestClientResult&lt;T&gt;</code><span>&nbsp;</span>with success/e=
rror state</li>
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"311">Optionally persists failed events=
 to Cosmos (configurable)</li>
</ol>
<hr class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"313">
<h3 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"315" id=3D"IDGraphRESTOutbo=
undClientAnalysis-R5.StandardizeRetryConfiguration">R5. Standardize Retry C=
onfiguration</h3>
<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"317"><strong>Priority</stron=
g>: MEDIUM</p>
<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"319"><strong>Problem</strong=
>: Retry patterns differ across clients:</p>
<ul class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"320">
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"320">Spring<span>&nbsp;</span><code>@R=
etryable</code><span>&nbsp;</span>annotations (CLMRestClient, ApiRestClient=
)</li>
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"321"><code>RetryTemplate</code><span>&=
nbsp;</span>beans (HaloCClientHelper, BbnmsClientHelper, McafeeClientHelper=
, MbizClientHelper)</li>
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"322">Manual retry loops (IdentityGraph=
Client in UserEventsMs)</li>
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"323">No retry (CustomerGraphMsClient, =
IdGraphMsClient)</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"325"><strong>Action</strong>=
:</p>
<ol class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"326">
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"326">Use<span>&nbsp;</span><code>Retry=
Template</code><span>&nbsp;</span>beans for all REST clients (consistent wi=
th extclienthelpers pattern)</li>
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"327">Configure retry via properties:<s=
pan>&nbsp;</span><code>apiclient.rest.&lt;clientKey&gt;.retry.maxAttempts</=
code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code>backoffDelay</code>,<span>&nbsp;</span><code=
>multiplier</code></li>
<li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"328">Define retryable exceptions consi=
stently: 5xx +<span>&nbsp;</span><code>ResourceAccessException</code><span>=
&nbsp;</span>=3D retryable; 4xx =3D non-retryable</li>
</ol>
<hr class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"330">
<h3 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"332" id=3D"IDGraphRESTOutbo=
undClientAnalysis-R6.ConnectionPoolIsolation">R6. Connection Pool Isolation=
</h3>
<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"334"><strong>Priority</stron=
g>: LOW<br><strong>Model</strong>:<span>&nbsp;</span><code>idgraphmpsadapte=
rms</code><span>&nbsp;</span>per-API<span>&nbsp;</span><code>maxConnections=
Total</code></p>
<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"337"><strong>Problem</strong=
>: Multiple clients sharing one<span>&nbsp;</span><code>RestTemplate</code>=
<span>&nbsp;</span>share one connection pool. A downstream outage exhausts =
the pool and impacts all APIs.</p>
<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"339"><strong>Action</strong>=
: For high-traffic MSes (ConsumerMs, UserEventsMs), create separate<span>&n=
bsp;</span><code>RestTemplate</code><span>&nbsp;</span>beans per downstream=
 target with isolated connection pools.</p>
<hr class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"341">
<h2 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"343" id=3D"IDGraphRESTOutbo=
undClientAnalysis-ProposedStandardizedRESTClientPattern">Proposed Standardi=
zed REST Client Pattern</h2>
